{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerwhatsappnumber:"]}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"NSString","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSString","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"number","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"number","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The phone number in E.164 international format.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Associates a WhatsApp number with the current device for WhatsApp Business API","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"messaging campaigns. This enables rich messaging with images, documents, and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"interactive buttons through WhatsApp.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The phone number must be in E.164 international format:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with ‘+’ followed by country code"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No spaces, dashes, or parentheses","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Must be a valid WhatsApp-enabled number","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Example","anchor":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register WhatsApp during communication preferences setup:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class CommunicationPreferencesManager {","","    struct Preferences {","        var pushEnabled: Bool","        var smsEnabled: Bool","        var whatsappEnabled: Bool","        var whatsappNumber: String?","    }","","    func savePreferences(_ preferences: Preferences) {","        \/\/ Register WhatsApp if user opted in and provided number","        if preferences.whatsappEnabled, let number = preferences.whatsappNumber {","            let normalizedNumber = normalizePhoneNumber(number)","            Pushwoosh.configure.registerWhatsappNumber(normalizedNumber)","        }","","        \/\/ Update channel preferences tags","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"channel_push\": preferences.pushEnabled,","            \"channel_sms\": preferences.smsEnabled,","            \"channel_whatsapp\": preferences.whatsappEnabled","        ])","    }","","    private func normalizePhoneNumber(_ phone: String) -> String {","        let digits = phone.filter { $0.isNumber }","        return phone.hasPrefix(\"+\") ? \"+\\(digits)\" : \"+\\(digits)\"","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a WhatsApp number for WhatsApp Business messaging."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)registerWhatsappNumber:","title":"registerWhatsappNumber:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerWhatsappNumber:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/registerWhatsappNumber:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerwhatsappnumber:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerWhatsappNumber:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers a WhatsApp number for WhatsApp Business messaging."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"registerWhatsappNumber:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerWhatsappNumber:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","abstract":[{"text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","role":"symbol","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PWConfiguration","type":"topic"}}}